t-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI MASAYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISSAN DIESEL MOTOR CO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, MASAYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISSAN DIESEL MOTOR CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI MASAYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, MASAYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An internal combustion engine mounted on a vehicle, wherein, when an auxiliary brake is switched from a non-operating state to an operating state, a fuel injection amount is increased gradually so as to switch a fuel injection amount to that according to an engine operating condition, whereby an excessive supply of fuel due to delay of activation of the auxiliary brake is prevented so as to improve the properties of exhaust gases.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un moteur à combustion interne monté sur un véhicule automobile, dans lequel, lorsqu'un frein auxiliaire passe d'un état de repos à un état de fonctionnement, une quantité de carburant injecté s'accroît progressivement afin de déclencher une injection de carburant selon le condition de fonctionnement du moteur, évitant ainsi une alimentation excessive en carburant due au retard de l'actionnement du frein auxiliaire afin d'améliorer les propriétés des gaz d'échappement.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>